      "content": "GPUType 的值契约不完整，且整条链路无校验：该值是 pricing table 中用户自定义的 YAML map key（ParseTable 仅 yaml.Unmarshal，无任何校验），被原样写入节点标签值（nodelabels.go 的 patch payload）并作为 CSV 的 InstanceID 列（pricing.go FormatCSV）。若 key 含空格、斜杠或超 63 字符（如 \"NVIDIA H100\"、\"H100 SXM\"——values.yaml 中 dcgm_model_match 正是 \"NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3\" 这种含空格命名风格），节点 patch 会被 API server 以 422 拒绝，60s Reconcile 循环中每轮重复失败且仅有一条日志，Node Label Bridge 对该节点静默失效（fork 端 GPUType()=\"\" → GPU 定价跳过 → GPU 成本 $0，恰是 ADR-0006 要解决的问题）；含逗号的 key 还会直接破坏 CSV 行结构。建议：在本契约文件中写明值必须满足 Kubernetes label value 语法（≤63 字符、`[A-Za-z0-9]([-A-Za-z0-9_.]*[A-Za-z0-9])?`、不含逗号），并在 ParseTable 中对 key 做前置校验，使配置错误在加载时快速失败，而非运行期反复 422。",
      "suggestion_code": "\t// GPUType carries the pricing-table type key (e.g. \"H100\"). OpenCost's\n\t// csvKey.GPUType() reads it via GPUMapFields (CSV gpu rows' InstanceIDField)\n\t// and matches GPUClassPricing.\n\t//\n\t// Value contract: the pricing-table key is written verbatim as a node label\n\t// value and as the CSV InstanceID, so it must be a valid Kubernetes label\n\t// value (≤63 chars, [A-Za-z0-9]([-A-Za-z0-9_.]*[A-Za-z0-9])?) and contain no\n\t// comma. ParseTable should reject invalid keys at load time — an invalid\n\t// key makes every node patch fail with 422 in the 60s reconcile loop and\n\t// silently drops that node's GPU pricing.\n\tGPUType = \"example.io/gpu-type\"",
      "existing_code": "\t// GPUType carries the pricing-table type key (e.g. \"H100\"). OpenCost's\n\t// csvKey.GPUType() reads it via GPUMapFields (CSV gpu rows' InstanceIDField)\n\t// and matches GPUClassPricing.\n\tGPUType = \"example.io/gpu-type\"",
